5,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? I'm going to find them!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Let us remain calm. We must observe each other carefully before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really know what to say. I hope we can all get along.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's all be friendly. We will find the truth together, gently.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Let's try to keep the peace while we figure this out.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're being too serious! Do you have a secret?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"I am simply being prudent, Rin. It is the best way to handle such a situation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,It's wonderful to see everyone participating. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,Not yet. It's too early to tell. I'm just listening for now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I bet it's someone who talks too much... or maybe someone who doesn't talk at all!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"That logic is a bit circular, isn't it?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm just a villager. I don't want anyone to be sad.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"You're very kind, Daisuke. We'll do our best to protect everyone.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,We should look for inconsistencies in how people speak as the days go by.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the night! I hope the Seer finds something cool!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
