31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anything happen? Who do we think is the bad guy?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,A quiet night. We must now decide if there is enough evidence to act.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'm... I'm scared. I don't want to vote for the wrong person.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"My dear friends, I'm afraid I have some troubling news to share with you all.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What is it, Shizue? You look very serious.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,Tell us! Tell us!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"Please, let's hear what you have to say, Shizue.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Is... is it something bad?,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I used my power last night, and I discovered that George is the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh my! Are you certain, Shizue? You're usually so gentle.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I knew it! George was being way too stiff!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,This is preposterous. Shizue is simply mistaken or lying to confuse us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,But Shizue wouldn't lie... would she?,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I promise you, I am telling the truth for the sake of our village.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,Shizue has never misled us before. I believe her.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,Let's get him! Vote for George!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,You are making a grave mistake. I am a human.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I trust Shizue. I'm sorry, George.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am sorry it had to be this way, George.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. The evidence from the Seer is too strong to ignore.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
